        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D11860, Traditional Egg Knob Entry Door Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Egg Knob Handleset will fit standard pre-drilled doors. It measures 10-5/8 inches tall. It is made for doors with thicknesses from 1-3/4 inches to 2 inches that have 2-3/8 inch to 2-3/4 inch backsets. Although the egg knob is traditional, this entry door lockset is not dated. Choose from one of the beautiful finishes to bring new life to your front door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEach set contains door knobs, backplates, latches, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D11860 Egg Knob Entry Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backplate Height 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and knob latch): 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" Thick Doors (Contact us if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard Pre-Drilled Doors, 2-1/8\" Bore Holes</li>\r\n<li>Will Fit Narrow Stiles (3-5/8\" with 2-3/8\" Backset Latches)</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Door Knobs and Trim</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard \"C\" keyway supplied with two nickel silver keys.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/entry-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262242\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Entry Lockset Dimensions & Specs (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dummy Pair: Stationary both sides of door. Fixed knobs, non-functioning. Used as door pulls or to match trim. </li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Entry: Latchbolt operates by knob from either side. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Entry: Latchbolt operates by knob from either side. Deadbolt activated only by key from either side. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Egg Knob Handleset, Omnia D11860",
                "description": "Omnia D11860 Entry Door Lockset - The Traditional Egg Knob Handleset will fit standard pre-drilled doors. It measures 10-5/8 inches tall. It is made for doors with thicknesses from 1-3/4 inches to 2 inches that have 2-3/8 inch to 2-3/4 inch backsets. Although the egg knob is traditional, this entry door lockset is not dated. Choose from one of the beautiful finishes to bring new life to your front door.\r\n",
